      en: ["The mountain is located in the country's first national park, established in 2007.", "The peak elevation is approximately 960 meters above sea level.", "The massif is primarily composed of limestone formations from the Cenozoic era.", "The region hosts 24 endemic bird species, including the Yellow-crested Cockatoo.", "The mountain is a sacred site (Lulik) for the Fataluku people.", "The area contains the largest remaining tract of contiguous forest on the island."],
