      en: ["Elevation: approx. 1,934 meters", "Location: Bobonaro Municipality", "Nearest major town: Maliana", "Part of Timor-Leste's central highland range", "Strategic site during the resistance (1975-1999)", "Home to diverse tropical montane forest ecosystems"],
